  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Àm-chīⁿ ê 3-goe̍h-thiⁿ"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">暗chīⁿ ê 3月天</h2><div><br /></div><p><b style=\"font-size: small;\">本專欄「台羅會交流道」ê稿由台灣羅馬字協會提供kap校對，編輯部無koh做文字編輯。</b></p><p><b style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：Ngô͘ Ka-bêng</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Hioh-khùn-ji̍t sòa chiap</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Éng-oán bē thêng-khùn ê la̍h-ji̍t</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Chheⁿ-hūn ê phàu-á</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Hòng-sàng hoaⁿ-hí khèng-chiok ê siaⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">228 tōa iu-thāi--o͘h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">228 tōa sio̍k-bē--o͘h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">228 1-kin ê sí-thé ta̍t gōa-chē</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Thâu-ke kā góa chhìn khòaⁿ-māi--leh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tâi-oân-hûn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tī tiām-chēng ê bāng-lō͘ tiàm-thâu--ni̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Po̍k-chà</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Chhī-chèng-hú ê mn̂g khui--khui</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Ka-hāi-chiá ê giân-gí</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Ta̍k-put-sî ùi góa ê ba̍k-chiu-jîn pa--koaih</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Ó--oh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Ó--oh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Koh pa--koaih</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tâi-oân-hûn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tī àm-so-so ê Tâi-oân-sú chheh-tû--ni̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Chhiō siáng ê chi̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Lāu-jia̍t ê Ài-hô kîⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Bó-gí thoa-bôa ê kha-jiah bô lâng ē thiaⁿ--kìⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tá-káu-káng ê âng-hê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Káⁿ-sī í-keng am-khàm 74-tang chêng ê hoeh-chúi</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Hô-pêng-chiáu m̄ bat chhut-sì</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Soaⁿ-àm-kong oa̍h tī “Chóng-chǹg kiô” ē-té ê àm-chīⁿ--ni̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Hām-bîn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Khó͘-thiàⁿ ê 3-goe̍h-thiⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Sit--khì ê hûn iáu-sī bô tit-tio̍h chèng-gī</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tn̄g--khì ê chi̍h chá to̍h kòe-ki hō͘ tùi-te̍k puh-íⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Mô͘-kúi ê chhiú kā lán ê sîn-hûn siàng lŏe thô͘--ni̍h seⁿ-thòaⁿ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Ē liáu bē chīn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">74-tang āu</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Sio-lō ê ba̍k-sái í-keng hu--khì</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Káⁿ-sī lán hòng-khì lán ka-tī</span></p><div><br /></div><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><br /></span><span><b>#台羅會交流道&nbsp;專欄，本文使用白話字。</b></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報327期，2021年6月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" dat